@ Textos de la intro del Prof. Rowan (adaptados de pokeplatinum, res/text/rowan_intro.json)

gText_RowanIntro_HelloThere::
	.string "Hello there! It's so very nice to meet\n"
	.string "you!\p"
	.string "Welcome to the world of POKéMON!\p$"

gText_RowanIntro_MyNameRowan::
	.string "My name is ROWAN.\p"
	.string "However, everyone just calls me the\n"
	.string "POKéMON Professor.\p"
	.string "Before I go any further, is this your\n"
	.string "first adventure?\p"
	.string "If you need advice, I'm certainly\n"
	.string "capable of giving it.$"

gText_RowanIntro_InfoAnythingElse::
	.string "Would you like to know more about\n"
	.string "anything else?$"

gText_RowanIntro_AdventureInfo0::
	.string "You are about to enter a world where\n"
	.string "you will embark on a grand adventure\l"
	.string "of your very own.\p$"

gText_RowanIntro_AdventureInfo1::
	.string "Speak to people and check things\n"
	.string "wherever you go, be it in towns, roads,\l"
	.string "or caves. Gather information and\l"
	.string "hints from every possible source.\p$"

gText_RowanIntro_AdventureInfo2::
	.string "New paths will open to you when you\n"
	.string "help people in need, overcome\l"
	.string "challenges, and solve mysteries.\p$"

gText_RowanIntro_AdventureInfo3::
	.string "At times, you will be challenged by\n"
	.string "others to a battle. At other times,\l"
	.string "wild creatures may stand in your way.\l"
	.string "By overcoming such hurdles, you will\l"
	.string "gain great power.\p$"

gText_RowanIntro_AdventureInfo4::
	.string "However, your adventure is not solely\n"
	.string "about becoming powerful.\p$"

gText_RowanIntro_AdventureInfo5::
	.string "On your travels, we hope that you will\n"
	.string "meet countless people and, through\l"
	.string "them, achieve personal growth. This is\l"
	.string "the most important objective of this\l"
	.string "adventure.\p$"

gText_RowanIntro_WidelyInhabited::
	.string "This world is widely inhabited by\n"
	.string "creatures known as POKéMON.\p$"

gText_RowanIntro_LiveAlongsidePokemon::
	.string "We humans live alongside POKéMON as\n"
	.string "friends.\p"
	.string "At times we play together, and at\n"
	.string "other times we work together.\p"
	.string "Some people use their POKéMON to\n"
	.string "battle and develop closer bonds with\l"
	.string "them.\p"
	.string "What do I do?\p"
	.string "I conduct research so that we may\n"
	.string "learn more about POKéMON.\p$"

gText_RowanIntro_AboutYourself::
	.string "Now, why don't you tell me a little bit\n"
	.string "about yourself?\p$"

gText_RowanIntro_GenderDialogue::
	.string "Are you a boy? Or are you a girl?$"

gText_RowanIntro_ConfirmBoy::
	.string "All right, so you're a boy?$"

gText_RowanIntro_ConfirmGirl::
	.string "All right, so you're a girl?$"

gText_RowanIntro_NameDialogue::
	.string "Tell me, what is your name?$"

gText_RowanIntro_ConfirmNameMale::
	.string "Your name is {PLAYER}?$"

gText_RowanIntro_SoYoure::
	.string "OK... So, you're {PLAYER}?\p"
	.string "A fine name that is!\p"
	.string "Now, this boy here... I believe he's\n"
	.string "your friend.\p$"

gText_RowanIntro_RivalNameDialogue::
	.string "What might his name be?$"

gText_RowanIntro_ConfirmRivalName::
	.string "{RIVAL}, is it? That's your friend's\n"
	.string "name?$"

gText_RowanIntro_EndDialogue::
	.string "All right, {PLAYER}, the time has come.\p"
	.string "Your very own tale of grand adventure\n"
	.string "is about to unfold.\p"
	.string "On your journey, you will meet\n"
	.string "countless POKéMON and people.\p"
	.string "I'm sure that along the way you will\n"
	.string "discover many things, perhaps even\l"
	.string "something about yourself.\p"
	.string "Now, go on, leap into the world of\n"
	.string "POKéMON!\p$"

gText_RowanIntro_ControlInfoUnderstood::
	.string "Do you understand everything so far?$"

gText_RowanIntro_HavePokeBall::
	.string "Here, I have a POKé BALL.\p"
	.string "Press the A Button to open it, if you'd\n"
	.string "please.$"

gText_RowanIntro_PokeBallUseButton::
	.string "No, no! Not that button! Press the A\n"
	.string "Button, if you'd please.\p$"

gText_RowanIntro_ControlInfo0::
	.string "The +Control Pad moves the main\n"
	.string "character. It is also used to choose\l"
	.string "various headings and selections.\p$"

gText_RowanIntro_ControlInfo1::
	.string "The A Button is used to confirm a\n"
	.string "choice, check things, chat, and scroll\l"
	.string "text.\p"
	.string "The B Button is used to exit, cancel a\n"
	.string "choice, and cancel a mode.\p$"

gText_RowanIntro_ControlInfo2::
	.string "Press START to open the menu.\p"
	.string "Press SELECT to use an item, such as a\n"
	.string "Bicycle, that has been registered in\l"
	.string "advance.\p$"

gText_RowanIntro_ControlInfo3::
	.string "The L and R Buttons can be used to\n"
	.string "switch pages and scroll lists in some\l"
	.string "menus.\p$"

gText_RowanIntro_ChoiceControlInfo::
	.string "CONTROL INFO$"

gText_RowanIntro_ChoiceAdventureInfo::
	.string "ADVENTURE INFO$"

gText_RowanIntro_ChoiceNoInfo::
	.string "NO INFO NEEDED$"

gText_RowanIntro_RivalChoiceNew::
	.string "NEW NAME$"

gText_RowanIntro_RivalChoiceBarry::
	.string "BARRY$"

gText_RowanIntro_RivalChoiceNolan::
	.string "NOLAN$"

gText_RowanIntro_RivalChoiceRoy::
	.string "ROY$"

gText_RowanIntro_RivalChoiceGavin::
	.string "GAVIN$"

gText_RowanIntro_Tv::
	.string "“POKéMON are by our side, always.\n"
	.string "I hope you will understand the meaning\n"
	.string "of those words.”\n"
	.string "\n"
	.string "That was the comment left by\n"
	.string "PROF. ROWAN, who has returned to\n"
	.string "Sinnoh from the Kanto region.$"
